      "answer": "The financial remedy offered to NordChemica if the 30-day target for actionable alerts per day is not met is a conditional 6% contract credit for the next year. This credit is tied to the success metrics of reducing actionable alerts by 70% within 30 days post-deployment of the tuning bundle and an agreed analytics baseline. The 6% credit is contingent on failing to meet the agreed reduction target and requires a clear baseline measurement before changes are applied. No further details on how the credit is applied or any alternative financial remedies are provided in the evidence [art_0a135c689c08, art_ffa7143fb822].",
