      "answer": "The temporary field mappings planned in the MapleHarvest Quebec pilot router transform include mapping the field \"txn_id\" to \"transaction_id\" and \"total_amount\" to \"amount_cents\". Additionally, there is type coercion from string to int for these fields. Key fields such as \"store_id\" and \"register_id\" are preserved. The transform also adds a flag field \"_ns_transform=true\" and enables OR-AUDIT-LOGS for each transformed event to ensure safety and auditability. This temporary transform is implemented in the SI-CLOUD-ROUTER component and outputs to a canonical topic. The planned deployment date for this transform is 2026-03-21, with Jin Park as the owner responsible for implementing the mapping rules and type coercion [art_5a91258f4056][art_6c5bb3a4b89f]. \n\nNo additional temporary field mappings beyond \"txn_id\" -> \"transaction_id\" and \"total_amount\" -> \"amount_cents\" with type coercion are detailed in the evidence; if other mappings exist, they are not documented in the provided artifacts.",
